// ========== SUPER ADMIN PLATFORM MODELS ==========
// The Super Admin dashboard sits above all school tenants. These models are
// deliberately school-scoped where they represent a school's data (wallets,
// subscriptions) and unscoped where they represent platform data (users of
// the platform console, notifications, platform expenses).

// ---- Platform console users (NOT school tenants) ----
model PlatformUser {
